{"id":"vod_lz_2048","vodId":"2048","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么","name_cn":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220328-1/7558589e4996d2e42c2f6f9210a10e9f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在拥有通称“地下城”的广阔的地下迷宫的迷宫都市欧拉丽，想成为冒险者并且向往像英雄冒险谭中那样的“与异性命运的邂逅”的主人公贝尔·克朗尼，在这个地方遇见了一位小“神仙”赫斯缇雅，而她正四处寻找自己“眷族”的成员。吃了不少“眷族”闭门羹的贝尔在听了其劝诱后，立马就决定加入。某日，贝尔在地下城遭到了怪物“弥诺陶洛斯”的袭击，由于水平之差而无计可施的贝尔面临走投无路的危机，而在千钧一发之际，最强冒险者艾丝·华伦斯坦出手相助。就在这一瞬间，贝尔对艾丝一见钟情。就这样，一段眷族神话正式拉开帷幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-03-28 19:48:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1637_330c5d24/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1640_3f2a9099/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1642_bf769543/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1644_e2279546/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1647_6eaf8315/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1649_869b0e7c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1650_a79543eb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1651_0afae303/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1652_b82682c3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1653_ddc0c096/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1654_c0160f53/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1655_6af9a8a9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220328/1656_ec8d08c2/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:37.494Z"}